# MODEL-G-039: Label A on metal1 2 2 8 8; erase metal1 0 0 5 10; then erase the rest (sticky variant not authored).
# Hefesto script (hefesto-cli --diagnostics=magic): the same commands.
tech load input/mt -noprompt
snap internal
load a
box 2 2 8 8
paint metal1
box 2 2 8 8
label A
box 0 0 5 10
erase metal1
save a1
box 0 0 10 10
erase metal1
save a2
